  "description": "Proposed works is Outbuilding- play room. The old plan (7.5x4.9) 36.75sq.m\n\nWe have increased the proposed size of the room by 11.38sq.m , so the proposed room size is (7.7x6.25)48.13 sq.m and would like to start the work by May 2026\nHeight of the top storey (floor height measured from the ground in metres) 2.5meter \n",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - Owing to the inclusion of primary living accommodation within the proposed outbuilding in the form of a bathroom, the scale of the proposed outbuilding, the sub-divided rear garden and the rear access to the proposed outbuilding, the proposal would raise the risk of facilitating uses which would be non-incidental to the main house and which could harm neighbouring living conditions of neighbours and the character of the area. As such, the proposal would fail to comply with adopted Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture) and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations) and the Hounslow Character, Sustainability and Design Codes SPD Part A5 � Residential Extension Guidelines"
